  "prefLabel": "Jus 813.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 813.01 Purpose. The rules in this part are intended to supplement any statutory provisions, including RSA 541, that require or allow a person to request a rehearing of a decision of an agency prior to appealing the decision.\n\nSource. #7129, eff 5-3-00",
